  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Regenerate Muscles",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Monster Codex pg. 224",
    "definition_raw": "Source Monster Codex pg. 224\nYou use your powerful metabolism to temporarily increase the strength of your muscles, but doing so costs you your regeneration powers.\n\nPrerequisites: Power Attack, regeneration, troll.\n\nBenefit: As a free action, you can make your regeneration stop working for 1 minute and gain a +2 enhancement bonus to your Strength. You lose your regeneration ability while you benefit from this bonus to Strength and for 1 minute afterward. You can end this ability early as a free action. You can activate this ability only if your regeneration is functioning.",
